        "person_id": "r33_ldy_qhx",
        "source_quote": "元嘉初，太祖遣大使巡行四方，兼散騎常侍孔默之、王歆之等上言：「宣威將軍、陳南頓二郡太守李元德，清勤均平，姦盜止息。",
        "reading": "宋文帝遣使；孔默之、王歆之等聯署。首薦陳、南頓二郡太守李元德，因清勤均平、盜止而受薦。",
        "note": "宋文帝遣使；孔默之、王歆之等聯署。首薦陳、南頓二郡太守李元德，因清勤均平、盜止而受薦。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 57,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence1-147",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "r33_ldy_qhx",
        "source_quote": "乃進元德號寧朔將軍，",
        "reading": "李元德自宣威將軍進號寧朔。",
        "note": "李元德自宣威將軍進號寧朔。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 147,
        "end_codepoint": 157,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence1-57",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "nqv_wp1_qxs",
        "source_quote": "彭城內史魏恭子，廉恪修慎，在公忘私，安約守儉，久而彌固。",
        "reading": "彭城內史，奏稱廉恪守儉。",
        "note": "彭城內史，奏稱廉恪守儉。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 57,
        "end_codepoint": 85,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence1-157",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "nqv_wp1_qxs",
        "source_quote": "恭子賜絹五十匹，穀五百斛，",
        "reading": "恭子獨得絹五十匹、穀五百斛。",
        "note": "恭子獨得絹五十匹、穀五百斛。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 157,
        "end_codepoint": 170,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence1-85",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "wyy_60g_333",
        "source_quote": "前宋縣令成浦，治政寬濟，遺詠在民。",
        "reading": "曾為宋縣令，治政寬濟，受合賜絹穀。",
        "note": "曾為宋縣令，治政寬濟，受合賜絹穀。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 85,
        "end_codepoint": 102,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence1-102",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "wdk_9mv_iba",
        "source_quote": "前鮦陽令李熙國，在事有方，民思其政。",
        "reading": "鮦陽前令，受稱在事有方。奏末與成浦、何道同額。",
        "note": "鮦陽前令，受稱在事有方。奏末與成浦、何道同額。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 102,
        "end_codepoint": 120,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence1-120",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "8vt_pms_6c3",
        "source_quote": "山桑令何道，自少清廉，白首彌厲。應加褒賚，以勸于後。」",
        "reading": "山桑令，少至白首清廉，奏尾總請褒賚。",
        "note": "山桑令，少至白首清廉，奏尾總請褒賚。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 120,
        "end_codepoint": 147,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence1-170",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "8vt_pms_6c3",
        "source_quote": "浦、熙國、道各賜絹三十匹，穀二百斛。",
        "reading": "成浦、李熙國、何道各絹三十匹、穀二百斛。",
        "note": "成浦、李熙國、何道各絹三十匹、穀二百斛。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 170,
        "end_codepoint": 188,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence2-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "601_nk5_c8m",
        "source_quote": "元嘉九年，豫州刺史長沙王義欣上言：「所統威遠將軍、北譙梁二郡太守關中侯申季歷，自奉職邦畿，于茲五年，信惠並宣，威化兼著，外清姦暴，內輯民黎，役賦均平，閭井齊肅，綏穆初附，招攜荒遠，郊境之外，仰澤懷風，爵賞之授，績能是顯，宜升階秩，以崇奬勸。」",
        "reading": "元嘉九年，長沙王劉義欣奏申季歷治北譙、梁二郡，在任五年。",
        "note": "元嘉九年，長沙王劉義欣奏申季歷治北譙、梁二郡，在任五年。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 121,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence2-121",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "601_nk5_c8m",
        "source_quote": "進號寧朔將軍。",
        "reading": "記治績及進寧朔將軍，不據五年推始任月日。",
        "note": "記治績及進寧朔將軍，不據五年推始任月日。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 121,
        "end_codepoint": 128,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence3-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "00l_vl7_anf",
        "source_quote": "其後晉壽太守郭啟玄亦有清節，卒官。",
        "reading": "晉壽太守，卒官。",
        "note": "晉壽太守，卒官。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 17,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence3-17",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "00l_vl7_anf",
        "source_quote": "元嘉二十八年，詔曰：「故綏遠將軍、晉壽太守郭啟玄往銜命虜庭，秉意不屈，受任白水，盡勤靡懈，公奉私餼，纖毫弗納，布衣蔬食，飭躬惟儉，故超授顯邦，以甄廉績。",
        "reading": "元嘉二十八年詔追敘使虜及治白水。",
        "note": "元嘉二十八年詔追敘使虜及治白水。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 17,
        "end_codepoint": 93,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence3-93",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "00l_vl7_anf",
        "source_quote": "而介誠苦節，終始匪貳，身死之日，妻子凍餒，志操殊俗，良可哀悼。",
        "reading": "詔稱身死後妻子凍餒。",
        "note": "詔稱身死後妻子凍餒。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 93,
        "end_codepoint": 124,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence3-124",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "00l_vl7_anf",
        "source_quote": "可賜其家穀五百斛。」",
        "reading": "贈穀五百斛給郭家。",
        "note": "贈穀五百斛給郭家。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 124,
        "end_codepoint": 134,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
