        "end_codepoint": 33,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence4-8",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "c4e_6tu_h2n",
        "source_quote": "潁川陳珉、",
        "reading": "潁川所出，與傅、張並舉。",
        "note": "潁川所出，與傅、張並舉。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 8,
        "end_codepoint": 13,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence4-33",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "c4e_6tu_h2n",
        "source_quote": "珉為吳令，善發姦伏，境內以為神明。",
        "reading": "自任吳令，善發姦伏；不是晉惠帝時的廣陵陳敏。",
        "note": "自任吳令，善發姦伏；不是晉惠帝時的廣陵陳敏。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 33,
        "end_codepoint": 50,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence4-13",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "swp_otp_irm",
        "source_quote": "高平張祐，並以吏才見知。",
        "reading": "高平，三人皆以吏才見知。",
        "note": "高平，三人皆以吏才見知。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 13,
        "end_codepoint": 25,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence4-50",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "swp_otp_irm",
        "source_quote": "祐祖父湛，晉孝武世，以才學為中書侍郎，光祿勳。祐歷臨安、武康、錢塘令，並著能名，宋世言長吏者，以三人為首。",
        "reading": "祖父張湛之中書侍郎、光祿勳在晉孝武世；張祐本人歷臨安、武康、錢塘令。末句合評三人。",
        "note": "祖父張湛之中書侍郎、光祿勳在晉孝武世；張祐本人歷臨安、武康、錢塘令。末句合評三人。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 50,
        "end_codepoint": 103,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xunli-xunxing:received_sentence5-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "12u_910_czm",
        "source_quote": "元嘉中，高平太守潘詞，有清節。",
        "reading": "元嘉中為高平太守，有清節。",
        "note": "元嘉中為高平太守，有清節。",
